  "translation": "Ka gobane bonela — ke beha kgahlanong le lena setšhaba, ntlo ya Yisraele, go bolela Yahwe, Elohim wa Tsebaote, gomme ba tlo go lo kgapeletša ⟨את⟩-lena go tšwa go ntlhagwano ya Khamate go fihla go noka ya mobu-ome.",
